{"title": "Trennbare Verben", "en": "Kofi's day: Ich stehe um sieben auf", "level": "A1", "lines": [{"kind": "section", "text": "Intro", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.0}, {"kind": "host", "spk": "H", "name": "Host", "text": "Welcome to Akoo, episode seven. Lena asks Kofi about his normal day. Just listen first.", "en": "", "start": 0.0, "words": [{"t": "Welcome", "s": 0.142, "e": 0.616}, {"t": "to", "s": 0.629, "e": 0.8}, {"t": "Akoo,", "s": 0.813, "e": 1.339}, {"t": "episode", "s": 1.629, "e": 2.155}, {"t": "seven.", "s": 2.168, "e": 2.682}, {"t": "Lena", "s": 3.079, "e": 3.566}, {"t": "asks", "s": 3.579, "e": 3.987}, {"t": "Kofi", "s": 4.0, "e": 4.592}, {"t": "about", "s": 4.605, "e": 4.921}, {"t": "his", "s": 4.934, "e": 5.092}, {"t": "normal", "s": 5.105, "e": 5.46}, {"t": "day.", "s": 5.474, "e": 5.921}, {"t": "Just", "s": 6.301, "e": 6.67}, {"t": "listen", "s": 6.683, "e": 7.064}, {"t": "first.", "s": 7.078, "e": 7.736}], "end": 8.136}, {"kind": "pause", "dur": 1.0, "start": 8.636, "end": 9.636}, {"kind": "section", "text": "Szene 1 · Kofis Tag", "start": 9.636, "end": 9.636}, {"kind": "line", "spk": "L", "name": "Lena", "text": "Kofi, was machst du jeden Tag? Wann stehst du auf?", "en": "Kofi, what do you do every day? When do you get up?", "start": 9.636, "words": [{"t": "Kofi,", "s": 9.747, "e": 10.357}, {"t": "was", "s": 10.585, "e": 10.845}, {"t": "machst", "s": 10.86, "e": 11.21}, {"t": "du", "s": 11.226, "e": 11.363}, {"t": "jeden", "s": 11.378, "e": 11.805}, {"t": "Tag?", "s": 11.82, "e": 12.262}, {"t": "Wann", "s": 13.325, "e": 13.676}, {"t": "stehst", "s": 13.691, "e": 14.087}, {"t": "du", "s": 14.102, "e": 14.27}, {"t": "auf?", "s": 14.285, "e": 14.743}], "end": 15.804}, {"kind": "line", "spk": "K", "name": "Kofi", "text": "Ich stehe um sieben Uhr auf. Dann trinke ich Kaffee.", "en": "I get up at seven. Then I drink coffee.", "start": 16.304, "words": [{"t": "Ich", "s": 16.354, "e": 16.644}, {"t": "stehe", "s": 16.659, "e": 17.208}, {"t": "um", "s": 17.223, "e": 17.452}, {"t": "sieben", "s": 17.467, "e": 17.909}, {"t": "Uhr", "s": 17.924, "e": 18.168}, {"t": "auf.", "s": 18.183, "e": 18.702}, {"t": "Dann", "s": 19.144, "e": 19.57}, {"t": "trinke", "s": 19.586, "e": 20.134}, {"t": "ich", "s": 20.15, "e": 20.333}, {"t": "Kaffee.", "s": 20.348, "e": 21.019}], "end": 21.464}, {"kind": "line", "spk": "L", "name": "Lena", "text": "Und wann fängt die Arbeit an?", "en": "And when does work start?", "start": 21.964, "words": [{"t": "Und", "s": 22.075, "e": 22.41}, {"t": "wann", "s": 22.426, "e": 22.746}, {"t": "fängt", "s": 22.761, "e": 23.066}, {"t": "die", "s": 23.081, "e": 23.249}, {"t": "Arbeit", "s": 23.264, "e": 23.767}, {"t": "an?", "s": 23.782, "e": 24.102}], "end": 25.156}, {"kind": "line", "spk": "K", "name": "Kofi", "text": "Die Arbeit fängt um neun an. Der Bus fährt um acht ab.", "en": "Work starts at nine. The bus leaves at eight.", "start": 25.656, "words": [{"t": "Die", "s": 25.717, "e": 26.159}, {"t": "Arbeit", "s": 26.174, "e": 26.677}, {"t": "fängt", "s": 26.693, "e": 27.074}, {"t": "um", "s": 27.089, "e": 27.287}, {"t": "neun", "s": 27.302, "e": 27.683}, {"t": "an.", "s": 27.699, "e": 28.141}, {"t": "Der", "s": 28.572, "e": 28.877}, {"t": "Bus", "s": 28.892, "e": 29.258}, {"t": "fährt", "s": 29.273, "e": 29.761}, {"t": "um", "s": 29.776, "e": 30.066}, {"t": "acht", "s": 30.081, "e": 30.432}, {"t": "ab.", "s": 30.447, "e": 30.843}], "end": 31.296}, {"kind": "line", "spk": "L", "name": "Lena", "text": "Und am Abend?", "en": "And in the evening?", "start": 31.796, "words": [{"t": "Und", "s": 31.907, "e": 32.303}, {"t": "am", "s": 32.319, "e": 32.562}, {"t": "Abend?", "s": 32.578, "e": 33.264}], "end": 34.316}, {"kind": "line", "spk": "K", "name": "Kofi", "text": "Am Abend kaufe ich ein. Dann rufe ich Abena an.", "en": "In the evening I go shopping. Then I call Abena.", "start": 34.816, "words": [{"t": "Am", "s": 34.866, "e": 35.262}, {"t": "Abend", "s": 35.278, "e": 35.765}, {"t": "kaufe", "s": 35.781, "e": 36.284}, {"t": "ich", "s": 36.299, "e": 36.543}, {"t": "ein.", "s": 36.558, "e": 36.985}, {"t": "Dann", "s": 37.427, "e": 37.762}, {"t": "rufe", "s": 37.778, "e": 38.342}, {"t": "ich", "s": 38.357, "e": 38.601}, {"t": "Abena", "s": 38.616, "e": 39.18}, {"t": "an.", "s": 39.195, "e": 39.622}], "end": 40.072}, {"kind": "line", "spk": "L", "name": "Lena", "text": "Wer ist Abena?", "en": "Who is Abena?", "start": 40.572, "words": [{"t": "Wer", "s": 40.683, "e": 41.14}, {"t": "ist", "s": 41.156, "e": 41.46}, {"t": "Abena?", "s": 41.476, "e": 42.131}], "end": 43.188}, {"kind": "line", "spk": "K", "name": "Kofi", "text": "Abena ist meine Schwester. Sie wohnt in Accra.", "en": "Abena is my sister. She lives in Accra.", "start": 43.688, "words": [{"t": "Abena", "s": 43.738, "e": 44.592}, {"t": "ist", "s": 44.607, "e": 44.912}, {"t": "meine", "s": 44.927, "e": 45.262}, {"t": "Schwester.", "s": 45.278, "e": 46.055}, {"t": "Sie", "s": 46.497, "e": 46.893}, {"t": "wohnt", "s": 46.909, "e": 47.412}, {"t": "in", "s": 47.427, "e": 47.671}, {"t": "Accra.", "s": 47.686, "e": 48.296}], "end": 48.752}, {"kind": "line", "spk": "L", "name": "Lena", "text": "Und dann? Siehst du fern?", "en": "And then? Do you watch TV?", "start": 49.252, "words": [{"t": "Und", "s": 49.363, "e": 49.698}, {"t": "dann?", "s": 49.714, "e": 50.186}, {"t": "Siehst", "s": 51.249, "e": 51.706}, {"t": "du", "s": 51.722, "e": 51.859}, {"t": "fern?", "s": 51.874, "e": 52.407}], "end": 53.452}, {"kind": "line", "spk": "K", "name": "Kofi", "text": "Nein, ich sehe nicht fern. Ich lerne Deutsch!", "en": "No, I don't watch TV. I study German!", "start": 53.952, "words": [{"t": "Nein,", "s": 54.005, "e": 54.569}, {"t": "ich", "s": 54.95, "e": 55.087}, {"t": "sehe", "s": 55.102, "e": 55.529}, {"t": "nicht", "s": 55.544, "e": 55.864}, {"t": "fern.", "s": 55.88, "e": 56.398}, {"t": "Ich", "s": 56.837, "e": 57.157}, {"t": "lerne", "s": 57.173, "e": 57.645}, {"t": "Deutsch!", "s": 57.661, "e": 58.255}], "end": 58.704}, {"kind": 